          "classification": "Unclassified",
          "discussion": "The removal of security objects from the database/DBMS would seriously degrade a system's information assurance posture. If such an action is attempted, it must be logged.\n\nTo aid in diagnosis, it is necessary to keep track of failed attempts in addition to the successful ones.",
