          "rule_version": "SRG-APP-000860-DB-000250",
          "rule_title": "The DBMS must, for password-based authentication, allow user selection of long passwords and passphrases, including spaces and all printable characters.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the DBMS to allow user selection of long passwords and passphrases, including spaces and all printable characters.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify the DBMS is configured to allow user selection of long passwords and passphrases, including spaces and all printable characters.\n\nIf the DBMS is not configured to allow user selection of long passwords and passphrases, including spaces and all printable characters, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
