          "comments": "Assessment recommendation: Likely covered\nEvidence state: source-inferred\nAssessed release: 2026.45.4-uds.1\nHorizon commit: b84b9afcd6983d553b6b8406317b6592ec90cb7c\n\nJustification: The deployment uses an automated cryptographic random generator for native DB credentials, providing stronger automated selection than a human password-strength helper. Human users select credentials at shared UDS, not a PostgreSQL password dialog.\n\nComponents: Delivered PostgreSQL service accounts and application database; UDS mesh and shared identity; no bundled Keycloak database\n\nOwner: Gallatin engineering/SRE (Horizon and self-managed UDS Core on MPN)\n\nNext action: Retain the192-bit generator and machine-account mapping; prohibit weaker user-supplied overrides or apply approved validation.\n\nEvidence:\n[re-database-machine-secrets] re-database-machine-secrets\nService/admin DB passwords generated with openssl rand -hex24 when not supplied, retained from existing Secrets on upgrade; app/openfga/admin are explicit deployment identities, not per-human accounts.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon-uds-bundle/blob/d528b7febf1ce8bb5ccf99661dade6ae09a84381/source/zarf.yaml\n\n[re-database-release] re-database-release\nSuccessful UDS push42114745685 packages2026.45.4-uds.1; platform-contract selects shared UDS identity/Core1.14.0, no bundled Keycloak image. Build-info identifies appb84b9af/build19710 and Postgres digest3431665ea7f0c2dfe4bef9673aac6221a58bdf910251857123b7fb363cbb030e from source9d3725b0/run41699186459.\nhttps://github.com/gallatinai/horizon-uds-bundle/actions/runs/42114745685",
          "finding_details": "Recommendation: Likely covered. The deployment uses an automated cryptographic random generator for native DB credentials, providing stronger automated selection than a human password-strength helper. Human users select credentials at shared UDS, not a PostgreSQL password dialog.\n\nNext action: Retain the192-bit generator and machine-account mapping; prohibit weaker user-supplied overrides or apply approved validation."
