          "rule_id_src": "SV-263620r982507_rule",
          "rule_id": "SV-263620r982507",
          "rule_version": "SRG-APP-000915-DB-000310",
          "rule_title": "The DBMS must provide protected storage for cryptographic keys with organization-defined safeguards and/or hardware protected key store.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the DBMS to provide protected storage for cryptographic keys with organization-defined safeguards and/or hardware protected key store.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify the DBMS is configured to provide protected storage for cryptographic keys with organization-defined safeguards and/or hardware protected key store.\n\nIf the DBMS is not configured to provide protected storage for cryptographic keys with organization-defined safeguards and/or hardware protected key store, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
